{"articleNo":"180886","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=180886&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017년 하반기 군산시 대학생 학자금이자 지원사업 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.09.22","hit":"3175","attachments":[{"name":"군산시대학생학자금이자지원(앞).jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=180886&attachNo=5205"},{"name":"군산시대학생학자금이자지원(뒤).jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=180886&attachNo=5774"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">군산</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">시에서는 군산지역 대학생들의 고등교육기회를 보장하고 재학기간동안 학업에 전념할 수 있도록 교육비 부담을 경감하기 위하여</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">「</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">군산시 대학생 학자금 이자지원 사업</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">」</span></u><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">을 시행중에 있으니 해당하는 학생은 참고바랍니다.</span>&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">1</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">신청기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2017. 10. 2.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 10. 31.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">화</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">2</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">대 상 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">주민등록상 군산시 주소인 전국대학의 재</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">휴</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">3</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">지원범위 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2016</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">월 이후 한국장학재단에서 대출 받은 학자금의 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2017</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">년 하반기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(‘17. 7. 1. ~ 12. 31.) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">발생이자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">4</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">온라인 또는 방문신청</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">온라인신청 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">군산시청 홈페이지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(http://www.gunsan.go.kr)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">방문신청 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">군산시청 인재양성과</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(7</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">층</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">5</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">제출서류 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">신청서</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">홈페이지 다운로드</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">주민등록등본</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">재학증명서</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
